.]\n\nEric Bischoff:\n\"You're not just washing your hair\u2014your hair's washing you! Snorlax Shampoo gives you the kind of hair every wrestling crowd will cheer about!\"\n\n[Eric sprays water over his hair, reaching for the slicked-back look, then turning and flexing his biceps with a smug, triumphant grin.]\n\nEric Bischoff:\n\"Feel like a WrestleMania World Champion when you step into the ring or out of the shower. Snorlax Shampoo: Shampoo like a king, look like a god.\"\n\n[The screen fades to a close-up of the Snorlax Shampoo logo and bottle, with bold, black text reading:]\n\nSnorlax Shampoo: Power in Every Lock\n\n[Background music swells as Eric tilts the bottle and sprays a small amount into his hair once more, flexing it out with glee and satisfaction.]\n\nEric Bischoff:\n\"Step up your game with Snorlax Shampoo! Raaah!\"\n\n[The screen fades to black with the commercial tagline in neon lights:]\n\nGet Shnamed with Snorlax Shampoo!\n\n[The commercial ends with a pop ring and Eric's voice resounding, \"Raaah!\"]\n\n[End of commercial]\n\n(SWITCHCONVERSATION)"}, {"key": [21, 3, "iso"], "traj": 2, "log_surv_q": -0.0005279723703024421, "log_surv_s": -0.00013463086651966297, "gen_len": 512, "bail_leak": false}, {"key": [21, 3, "iso"], "traj": 3, "log_surv_q": -0.008389380462227713, "log_surv_s": -0.0001740976007276602, "gen_len": 512, "bail_leak": false}, {"key": [28, 3, "iso"], "traj": 0, "log_surv_q": -5.610969729551684e-07, "log_surv_s": -1.4333535354086545e-06, "gen_len": 169, "bail_leak": false}, {"key": [28, 3, "iso"], "traj": 1, "log_surv_q": -5.908770109942345e-08, "log_surv_s": -4.094428832405233e-08, "gen_len": 67, "bail_leak": false}, {"key": [28, 3, "iso"], "traj": 2, "log_surv_q": -6.176948105738393e-09, "log_surv_s": -6.4639862733456e-09, "gen_len": 64, "bail_leak": false}, {"key": [28, 3, "iso"], "traj": 3, "log_surv_q": -3.3536487270535262e-09, "log_surv_s": -2.7340083150305666e-09, "gen_len": 65, "bail_leak": false}, {"key": [34, 3, "iso"], "